    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young chef leaps off the couch, stretches himself, and rubs his eyes hard.\nThe kitchen before him remains the same, pots and pans all in place.\nHe seems to suddenly think of something, and hurriedly opens a cupboard, taking out bottles of oil, salt, soy sauce, and vinegar.\nCarefully, he drips a drop from each bottle into his mouth one by one, his brows tightly knit, deep in thought.\nOnly after a long time does a smile appear on his face."
